00000000  signed: 0  unsigned: 0
00000001  signed: 1  unsigned: 1
00000101  signed: 5  unsigned: 5
01111111  signed: 127  unsigned: 127
11111111  signed: -1  unsigned: 255
11111011  signed: -5  unsigned: 251
10000000  signed: -128  unsigned: 128

5            00000101
flip all     11111010
add one      11111011  read as signed: -5

200 stored in a signed byte reads as -56
127 + 1 stored in a signed byte reads as -128
